// Run this file in the Ingestion database.
// FOCUS-conformant GitHub Copilot cost feed. Column set is Costs_final_v1_2
// (the FinOps hub's real FOCUS 1.2-conformant cost table, captured from
// JerryMSFT/hackathon-jerry's hub_schema.py) plus the proposed x_AI* token/agent
// extension family. FOCUS is additive across versions, so this stays
// conformant with 1.4 and the upcoming 1.5 without rework.
// This is a NEW, parallel table -- GitHubCopilot_raw/_final_v1_0 (Budget/Seat/
// UsageDaily) is untouched.

